
1.1 Architecture
Model Name: MalxLabs-V4

Base Architecture: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B

Parameter Count: 1.5 Billion

Quantization: GGUF (Q4_K_M)

Primary Objective: High-precision technical reasoning and code generation.

1.2 Training Methodology
Training Hardware: NVIDIA RTX 4500 Ada (24GB VRAM) via RunPod.

Storage Allocation: 80GB Volume.

Training Type: Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT).

Datasets:

OpenMathInstruct-2: Injected for step-by-step mathematical reasoning.

CodeFeedback-Filtered: Focused on Luau and Python script structure and optimization.

Method: Dataset streaming was utilized to maintain high throughput during the RunPod session.
